      "type": "text",
      "text": "Ivermectin 0.5% lotion: apply to dry hair and scalp, rinse after 10 minutes; one application is enough (lice hatching from treated eggs die within 48 hours). Age over 6 months"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
